1
00:00:01,000 --> 00:00:06,500
Most high-security perimeters already have CCTV cameras, but no team can watch dozens of feeds at once.

2
00:00:06,600 --> 00:00:12,000
Border-AI transforms existing IP camera streams into an automated, real-time intelligence system.

3
00:00:12,100 --> 00:00:19,500
It detects threats, scores risks, and guides operator action without replacing existing hardware.

4
00:00:20,000 --> 00:00:25,000
Video streams over standard RTSP. The AI engine detects and tracks people and vehicles.

5
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:30,000
It reads license plates with multi-frame consensus, evaluates declarative rules, and scores risk.

6
00:00:30,100 --> 00:00:38,000
Events flow through Redis Streams into PostgreSQL, a sub-50 millisecond WebSocket gateway, and email alerts.

7
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:51,000
Scenario One: someone crosses an outer tripwire and enters a restricted compound after 10 PM.

8
00:00:51,100 --> 00:00:56,500
The platform correlates three signals: restricted zone entry for thirty points,

9
00:00:56,600 --> 00:01:02,000
virtual line crossing for twenty, and after-hours movement for ten points.

10
00:01:02,100 --> 00:01:08,000
Together, they calculate an explainable threat score of sixty, triggering a High-Priority alert.

11
00:01:35,000 --> 00:01:41,000
Scenario Two: a vehicle flagged on the stolen vehicle watchlist approaches the facility gate.

12
00:01:41,100 --> 00:01:47,000
Watchlist hit plus restricted area plus night clock escalates the threat score to eighty—Critical.

13
00:01:47,100 --> 00:01:53,000
A toast chimes immediately on screen, and an email is dispatched with the evidence snapshot.

14
00:01:53,100 --> 00:02:00,000
With a single click, an operator acknowledges the incident, instantly updating all active consoles.

15
00:02:40,000 --> 00:02:46,000
For investigators, the forensic workbench supports exact and look-alike plate search.

16
00:02:46,100 --> 00:02:52,500
A target vehicle is traced across cameras one, two, and four, charting transit times and travel plausibility.

17
00:02:52,600 --> 00:02:59,000
Impossible speed anomalies are flagged if counterfeit plates appear simultaneously at two distant gates.

18
00:03:40,000 --> 00:03:46,000
Rules are configuration, not hardcoded logic. Security administrators can define complex rules

19
00:03:46,100 --> 00:03:52,000
without retraining machine learning models. System health and streaming queues are monitored live.

20
00:04:10,000 --> 00:04:16,000
Engineered for operational resilience: local journals guarantee zero telemetry drops during outages,

21
00:04:16,100 --> 00:04:22,000
role-based access control enforces data privacy, and immutable hash chains secure the audit log.

22
00:04:22,100 --> 00:04:28,000
The entire platform launches with a single command via Docker Compose.

23
00:04:40,000 --> 00:04:46,000
Measured on verified test sets: 86.4% detection mAP, 98.4% ANPR consensus,

24
00:04:46,100 --> 00:04:52,000
zero false alerts over four hours of video, and eight cameras sustained on a single workstation.

25
00:04:52,100 --> 00:04:59,000
All code, decisions, and reports are on GitHub. Built for perimeter intelligence—with privacy by design.
